**Result: automated PASS; visual evidence incomplete.**

One headed Chromium run, using installed `app/@playwright/test` 1.61.1.
Fresh contexts at 1440x960 and 390x844. The ephemeral loopback server and browser
were closed. No external requests, page errors, request failures, input/answer UI,
KaTeX errors or page-wide horizontal overflow were observed.

